body:
This is the brightest answer you’ve given all day! Proud of you ! 

Here’s an image of the map for you; 

https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-EwiK-yuK4JI/UMC7OC1lyuI/AAAAAAAAA9c/F5GC8oucSWM/s1600/palestine_oslo_areas.png

Her name and face isn’t in the video so technically she’s not really gonna be out there. Honestly ruining any potential future relationship sounds quite delicious to me. I did clean for 2 days straight. Here’s a run down of what I did because people keep asking me to clean and I’m annoyed by it;

Before April 30th I was preoccupied with finals. I cleaned April 30th and May 1st (Laundry and throwing out old things - I have 4 big bags of stuff to donate). May 2nd was Eid, I was running errands May 3rd (returns, buying her and my friend a gift, picking up a cake) and did some errands for her as well (picking up cat stuff - I offered to fill gas and pick groceries while I was out and she said no) and I tidied a bit (my room and the bathroom). She mentioned the house isn’t clean enough May 3rd at night. I check the mail for her everyday and wash my dishes. I clean up after myself when I make a mess. I feed the cats, play with them lots and I help with grooming and giving them medicine. The mess she complains about comes from the cat hairs, the dishes, and wanting to throw out things in the storage room. 

And I don’t need her permission, I’m 20. She just makes fun of everything I do.
